---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Support · FocusQuest">
  <section class="page support-page">
    <div class="doc-eyebrow">Help</div>
    <h1>Support</h1>
    <p class="lede">FocusQuest is built and maintained by one person. I read every email and reply within a few business days.</p>

    <div class="support-block">
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>For bug reports, account questions, refund inquiries, or anything else — email is the fastest way to reach me.</p>
      <a class="contact" href="mailto:kaumon.business@gmail.com">kaumon.business@gmail.com</a>
    </div>

    <div class="support-block">
      <h2>Delete your account</h2>
      <p>You can permanently delete your account and all associated data at any time, from inside the app: <strong>Settings → Delete Account → Confirm.</strong></p>
      <p>Deletion is immediate. If you can't access the in-app flow, email me from the address linked to your account and I'll delete it manually.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="support-block">
      <h2>Manage your subscription</h2>
      <p>Pro Membership is billed by Apple. Cancel via iOS Settings → [your name] → Subscriptions → FocusQuest. Refunds via <a href="https://reportaproblem.apple.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">reportaproblem.apple.com</a>.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="support-block">
      <h2>Report a problem</h2>
      <p>Please include your character name, your iOS version, and what you were doing when it happened. That makes fixing it dramatically faster.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
